#: cups/kmwbanners.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<p>Select the default banners associated with this printer. These banners "
"will be inserted before and/or after each print job sent to the printer. If "
"you don't want to use banners, select <b>No Banner</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Izaberite podrazumijevanu traku koja će biti spojena sa ovim printerom. "
"Ove trake će biti ubačene prije i/ili poslije svakog zadatka poslanog na "
"printer. Ukoliko ne želite koristite trake, odaberite  <b>No Banner</b>.</p>."

