#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:40
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Characters Per Inch</b></p> <p>This setting controls the "
"horizontal size of characters when printing a text file. </p> <p>The default "
"value is 10, meaning that the font is scaled in a way that 10 characters per "
"inch will be printed. </p> <hr />  <p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:"
"</b> This KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS command line job "
"option parameter:</em> <pre>    -o cpi=...          # example: \"8\" or "
"\"12\"  </pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Karakteri po inčima</b></p> <p>Ovo podešenje kontorlira "
"horizontalnu veličinu karaktera prilikom štampanja tekstualnih dokumenata. </"
"p> <p> Početna podešena vrijednost je 10, što znači da je font određen na "
"način da će 10 karaktera biti odštampano. </p> <hr /> <p><em><b> Dodatni "
"savjet korisnicima:</b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS komandnu "
"opciju parametra:</em> <pre> -o cpi=... # primjer: \"8\" or \"12\" </pre> </"
"p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:54
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Lines Per Inch</b></p>  <p>This setting controls the vertical "
"size of characters when printing a text file. </p> <p>The default value is "
"6, meaning that the font is scaled in a way that 6 lines per inch will be "
"printed. </p>  <hr />  <p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This "
"KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS command line job option "
"parameter:</em> <pre>    -o lpi=...         # example \"5\" or \"7\"  </pre> "
"</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Linija po inču</b></p> <p>Ovo podešenje kontorlira vertikalnu "
"veličinu karaktera prilikom štampanja tekstualnih dokumenata. </p> <p> "
"Početna podešena vrijednost je 6, što znači da je font određen na način da "
"će 6 linija biti odštampano. </p> <hr /> <p><em><b> Dodatni savjet "
"korisnicima:</b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS komandnu opciju "
"parametra:</em> <pre> -o lpi=... # primjer: \"5\" or \"7\" </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:68
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Columns</b></p> <p>This setting controls how many columns of "
"text will be printed on each page when printing text files. </p> <p>The "
"default value is 1, meaning that only one column of text per page will be "
"printed. </p> <hr />  <p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This "
"KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS command line job option "
"parameter:</em> <pre>    -o columns=...     # example: \"2\" or \"4\"  </"
"pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Kolone</b></p> <p>Ovo podešenje kontorlira koliko će kolona "
"teksta biti odštampano na svakoj stranici prilikom štampanja tekstualnih "
"dokumenata. </p> <p> Početno podešena vrijednost je 1,što znači da će biti "
"odštampana samo jedna kolona teksta po stranici. </p> <hr /> <p><em><b> "
"Dodatni savjet korisnicima:</b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS "
"komandnu opciju parametra:</em> <pre> -o columns=... # primjer: \"2\" or "
"\"4\" </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:83
msgid " <qt>  Preview icon changes when you turn on or off prettyprint.  </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>  Ikona pregleda mijenja se kada uključite ili isključite prettyprint.  "
"</qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:86
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Text Formats</b></p> <p>These settings control the appearance of "
"text on printouts. They are only valid for printing text files or input "
"directly through kprinter. </p> <p><b>Note:</b> These settings have no "
"effect whatsoever for input formats other than text, or for printing from "
"applications such as the KDE Advanced Text Editor. (Applications in general "
"send PostScript to the print system, and 'kate' in particular has its own "
"knobs to control the print output.)</p>. <hr /> <p><em><b>Additional hint "
"for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS "
"command line job option parameter:</em> <pre>     -o cpi=...         # "
"example: \"8\" or \"12\"  <br />     -o lpi=...         # example: \"5\" or "
"\"7\"  <br />     -o columns=...     # example: \"2\" or \"4\"  </pre> </p> "
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Formati teksta</b></p> <p>Ova podešavanja kontroliraju izgled "
"teksta na ispisu.Jedino su ispravna za štampanje tekstnih dokumenata ili "
"direktan output na kprinter.</p> <p><b>Napomena:</b> Ova podešavanja ipak "
"nemaju uticaja na format unosa koji nisu u obliku teksta,ili na štampu sa "
"aplikacija kao što je KDE Napredni Text Uređivač (KDE Advanced Text Editor)."
"(Aplikacija u biti šalje PostScript u print sistem a 'kate' pogotovo ima "
"tipke za kontrolu štampanja ispisa.)</p>. <hr /> <p><em><b> Dodatni savjet "
"za napredne korisnike </b>: Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS "
"komandnu opciju parametra:</em> <pre> -o cpi=... # example: \"8\" or \"12\" "
"<br /> -o lpi=... # example: \"5\" or \"7\" <br /> -o columns=... # example: "
"\"2\" or \"4\" </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:107
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Margins</b></p> <p>These settings control the margins of "
"printouts on the paper. They are not valid for jobs originating from "
"applications that define their own page layout internally and send "
"PostScript to KDEPrint (such as KOffice or OpenOffice.org). </p> <p>When "
"printing from KDE applications, such as KMail and Konqueror, or printing an "
"ASCII text file through kprinter, you can choose your preferred margin "
"settings here. </p> <p>Margins may be set individually for each edge of the "
"paper. The combo box at the bottom lets you change the units of measurement "
"between Pixels, Millimeters, Centimeters, and Inches. </p> <p>You can even "
"use the mouse to grab one margin and drag it to the intended position (see "
"the preview picture on the right side).</p> <hr /> <p><em><b>Additional hint "
"for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS "
"command line job option parameter:</em> <pre>     -o page-top=...      # "
"example: \"72\"  <br />     -o page-bottom=...   # example: \"24\"  <br /"
">     -o page-left=...     # example: \"36\"  <br />     -o page-"
"right=...    # example: \"12\"  </pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Margine</b></p> <p> Ova podešavanja kontrolišu margine ispisa na "
"papiru.Nisu ispravna za zadatke sa drugih aplikacija koje definišu unutarnji "
"raspored njihove stranice i šalju PostScript u KDEPrint(kao što je  KOffice "
"ili OpenOffice.org). </p> <p> Prilikom štampanja iz KDE aplikacija,kao što "
"su  KMail i Konqueror,ili štampanja ASCII tekstualnog dokumenta kroz "
"kprinter,možete odabrati vaša preferirana podešavanja margina ovdje. </p> "
"<p> Margine mogu biti podešene individualno za svaki rub papira.Combo box na "
"kraju vam dozvoljava da promijenite mjerne jedinice između pixela,milimetara,"
"centimetara ili inča.. </p> <p> Čak možete koristiti i miš da njime povučete "
"jednu marginu do željenog mjesta(pogledajte preglednu sliku na desnoj "
"strani).</p> <hr /> <p><em><b> Dodatni savjet za napredne korisnike:</b> "
"Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS komandnu opciju parametra:</em> "
"<pre> -o page-top=... # example: \"72\" <br /> -o page-bottom=... # example: "
"\"24\" <br /> -o page-left=... # example: \"36\" <br /> -o page-right=... # "
"example: \"12\" </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:133
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Turn Text Printing with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint) On.</"
"b></p> <p>ASCII text file printouts can be 'prettyfied' by enabling this "
"option. If you do so, a header is printed at the top of each page. The "
"header contains the page number, job title (usually the filename), and the "
"date. In addition, C and C++ keywords are highlighted, and comment lines are "
"italicized.</p> <p>This prettyprint option is handled by CUPS.</p> <p>If you "
"prefer another 'plaintext-to-prettyprint' converter, look for the "
"<em>enscript</em> pre-filter on the <em>Filters</em> tab. </p> <br /> <hr /> "
"<p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element "
"corresponds to the CUPS command line job option parameter:</em> <pre>     -o "
"prettyprint=true.  </pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Uključi Text Printing with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint).</"
"b></p> <p>ASCII tekstualni dokument ispisa može 'prettyfied' ako omogućimo "
"tu opciju. Ako dozvolite, header je štampan na vrhu svake stranice. Header "
"se sastoji od broja stranice,  naslova (koji često predstavlja naziv "
"datoteke), i datuma. U dodatku, C i C++ ključne riječi su istaknute, i "
"komentarisani redovi su ukošeni</p> <p>Ova prettyprint opcija je upravljana "
"sa CUPS.</p> <p>Ako preferirate druge 'plaintext-to-prettyprint' pretvarače, "
"potražite <em>enscript</em> pre-filter on the <em>Filters</em> tab. </p> "
"<br /> <hr /> <p><em><b>Dodatni savjet korisnicima:</b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI "
"element odgovara na CUPS komandnu opciju parametra:</em> <pre> -o "
"prettyprint=true. </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:152
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Turn Text Printing with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint) Off.</"
"b></p> <p>ASCII text file printed with this option turned off appear without "
"a page header and without syntax highlighting. (You can still set the page "
"margins, though.)</p> <br /> <hr /> <p><em><b>Additional hint for power "
"users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS command line "
"job option parameter:</em> <pre>    -o prettyprint=false  </pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Isključi Printing with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint).</b></"
"p> <p>ASCII tekstualni dokument odštampan sa opcijom isključi pojavljuje se "
"bez hedera na stranicama i bez istaknutih riječi (Još uvijek možete "
"postaviti margine)</p> <br /> <hr /> <p><em><b>Dodatni savjet korisnicima:</"
"b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS komandnu opciju parametra:</"
"em> <pre> -o prettyprint=false </pre> </p> </qt>"

#: cups/kptextpage.cpp:166
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Print Text with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint)</b></p>  "
"<p>ASCII file printouts can be 'prettyfied' by enabling this option. If you "
"do so, a header is printed at the top of each page. The header contains the "
"page number, job title (usually the filename), and the date. In addition, C "
"and C++ keywords are highlighted, and comment lines are italicized.</p> "
"<p>This prettyprint option is handled by CUPS.</p> <p>If you prefer another "
"'plaintext-to-prettyprint' converter, look for the <em>enscript</em> pre-"
"filter on the <em>Filters</em> tab. </p> <br /> <hr /> <p><em><b>Additional "
"hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI element corresponds to the CUPS "
"command line job option parameter:</em> <pre>     -o prettyprint=true.  <br /"
">     -o prettyprint=false  </pre> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Štampaj Text Printing with Syntax Highlighting (Prettyprint).</"
"b></p> <p>ASCII tekstualni dokument ispisa može biti 'prettyfied' ako "
"omogućimo tu opciju. Ako dozvolite, header je štampan na vrhu svake "
"stranice. Header se sastoji od broja stranice,  naslova (koji često "
"predstavlja naziv datoteke), i datuma. U dodatku, C i C++ ključne riječi su "
"istaknute, i komentarisani redovi su ukošeni</p> <p>Ova prettyprint opcija "
"je upravljana sa CUPS.</p> <p>Ako preferirate druge 'plaintext-to-"
"prettyprint' pretvarače, potražite <em>enscript</em> pre-filter on the "
"<em>Filters</em> tab. </p> <br /> <hr /> <p><em><b>Dodatni savjet "
"korisnicima:</b> Ovaj KDEPrint GUI element odgovara na CUPS komandnu opciju "
"parametra:</em> <pre> -o prettyprint=true. <br /> -o prettyprint=false  </"
"pre> </p> </qt>"

