#: kpfilterpage.cpp:40
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Add Filter button</b> <p>This button calls a little dialog to let "
"you select a filter here.</p> <p><b>Note 1:</b> You can chain different "
"filters as long as you make sure that the output of one fits as input of the "
"next. (KDEPrint checks your filtering chain and will warn you if you fail to "
"do so).</p> <p><b>Note 2:</b> The filters you define here are applied to "
"your jobfile <em><b>before</b></em> it is handed downstream to your spooler "
"and print subsystem (e.g. CUPS, LPRng, LPD.)</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Dugme Dodaj Filter</b> <p>Ovo dugme poziva mali dijalog prozor koji "
"omogućava odabir filtera.</p> <p><b>Napomena 1:</b> Možete lančano povezati "
"različite filtere dok god ste sigurni da izlaz jednoga odgovara ulazu "
"drugog. (KDEPrint provjerava vaš lanac filtera te će vas napomenuti ukoliko "
"nije pravilan).</p> <p><b>Napomena 2:</b> Filteri koje definišete ovdje su "
"primjenjeni na vaš zadani fajl <em><b>prije</b></em> nego je predan dalje "
"spuleru i printerskom podsistemu (npr. CUPS, LPRng, LPD.)</p> </qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:51
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Remove Filter button</b> <p>This button removes the highlighted "
"filter from the list of filters.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Dugme Obrisi Filter</b> <p>Ovo dugme briše označeni filter iz liste "
"filtera.</p> </qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:56
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Move Filter Up button</b> <p>This button moves the highlighted "
"filter up in the list of filters, towards the front of the filtering chain. "
"</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><p>Ovo dugme pomjera istaknutu datoteku za jedno mjesto na gore u listi "
"datoteka za štampanje.</p><p>Prosto rečeno, ovo mijenja redoslijed datoteka "
"za štampanje.</p></qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:61
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Move Filter Down button</b> <p>This button moves the highlighted "
"filter down in the list of filters, towards the end of the filtering chain.."
"</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt><p>Ovo dugme pomjera istaknutu datoteku za jedno mjesto na dolje u "
"listi datoteka za štampanje.</p><p>Prosto rečeno, ovo mijenja redoslijed "
"datoteka za štampanje.</p></qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:66
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Configure Filter button</b> <p>This button lets you configure the "
"currently highlighted filter. It opens a separate dialog.  </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt>Ovo dugme uklanja istaknutu datoteku iz liste datoteka za štampanje.</"
"qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:72
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Filter Info Pane</b> <p>This field shows some general info about "
"the selected filter. Amongst them are:  <ul>  <li>the <em>filter name</em> "
"(as displayed in the KDEPrint user interface);</li>  <li>the <em>filter "
"requirements</em> (that is the external program that needs to be present and "
"executable on this system);</li> <li>the <em>filter input format</em> (in "
"the form of one or several <em>MIME types</em> accepted by the filter);</li> "
"<li>the <em>filter output format</em> (in the form of a <em>MIME type</em> "
"generated by the filter);</li> <li>a more- or less-verbose description of "
"the filter's operation.</li> </ul> </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Filter Info Pane</b> <p>Ovo polje predstavlja neke osnovne "
"informacije o izabranim filterima. Izmedju kojih su: <ul> <li>the <em>Ime "
"filtera</em> (Prikazano na KDEPrint korisnikovom interfejsu);</li> <li>the "
"<em>zahtjevi za filtriranje</em> (to je vanjski program koji treba da bude "
"prisutan i izvršen u ovom sistemu);</li> <li>the <em>Ulazni format filtera</"
"em> (u formi jednog ili nekoliko<em>MIME tipova</em> prihvaćenih od strane "
"filtera);</li> <li>the <em>Izlazni format filtera</em> (u formi od <em>MIME "
"tipova</em> generisanih od strane filtera);</li> <li>a više-manje-preopširan "
"opis filterskog rada</li> </ul> </p> </qt>"

#: kpfilterpage.cpp:88
msgid ""
" <qt> <b>Filtering Chain</b> (if enabled, is run <em>before</em> actual job "
"submission to print system.) <p>This field shows which filters are currently "
"selected to act as 'pre-filters' for KDEPrint. Pre-filters process the print "
"files <em>before</em> they are sent down-stream to your real print subsystem."
"</p> <p>The list shown in this field may be empty (default).</p> <p>The pre-"
"filters act on the print job in the order they are listed (from top to "
"bottom). This is done by acting as a <em>filtering chain</em> where the "
"output of one filter acts as input to the next. By putting the filters into "
"the wrong order, you can make the filtering chain fail. For example: if your "
"file is ASCII text, and you want the output being processed by the "
"'Multipage per Sheet' filter, the first filter must be one that converts "
"ASCII into PostScript.</p> <p>KDEPrint can utilize <em>any</em> external "
"filtering program which you may find useful through this interface.</p> "
"<p>KDEPrint ships preconfigured with support for a selection of common "
"filters. These filters however need to be installed independently from "
"KDEPrint. These pre-filters work <em>for all</em> print subsystems supported "
"by KDEPrint (such as CUPS, LPRng and LPD), because they are not dependent "
"upon them.</p>.<p>Amongst the pre-configured filters shipping with KDEPrint "
"are:</p> <ul> <li>the <em>Enscript text filter</em>;</li> <li>a <em>Multiple "
"Pages per Sheet filter</em>;</li> <li>a <em>PostScript to PDF converter</em>;"
"</li> <li>a <em>Page Selection/Ordering filter</em>;</li> <li>a <em>Poster "
"Printing filter</em>;</li> <li>and some more....</li> </ul> <p>To insert a "
"filter into this list, simply click on the <em>funnel</em> icon (top-most "
"on  the right icon column group) and proceed.</p> <p>Please click on the "
"other elements of this dialog to learn more about the KDEPrint pre-filters. "
"</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <b>Niz Filtera</b> ukoliko je omogućen, pokreće se <em>prije</em> "
"predavanja zadatka sistemu štampe.) <p>Ovo polje prikazuje koji su filteri "
"trenutno odabrani da budu 'pred-filteri' za KDEPrint. Pred'-filteri obrađuju "
"datoteke štampe <em>prije</em> nego što su poslani u vaš pravi podsistem "
"štampe.</p> <p>Lista prikazana u ovom polju može biti prazna "
"(podrazumijevano).</p> <p>Pred filteri utiču na štampanje po redu kako su "
"prikazani (odozgo prema dole). Ovo je obavljeno kao  <em>niz filtera</em> "
"gdje je izlaz jednog filtera ulaz drugog filtera. Postavljanjem filtera u "
"pogrešan redosljed možete učiniti da niz filtera ne radi. Primjer: ako je "
"vaša datoteka ASCII tekst, i želite da izlaz bude obrađen filterom 'Više "
"stranica po listu' , prvi filter mora biti onaj koji konvertuje ASCII tekst "
"u PostScript.</p> <p>KDEPrint može koristiti <em>bilo koji</em> vanjski "
"program za filtriranje koji možete naći korisnim u ovom sučelju.</p> "
"<p>KDEPrint je prekonfigurisan sa podrškom za izbor uobičajenih filtera. "
"Međutim ovi filteri se moraju instalirati odvojeno od KDEPrint-a. Ovi pred-"
"filteri rade <em>za sve</em> podsisteme štampe podržane od KDEPrint-a (poput "
"CUPS, LPRng i LPD), kako nisu zavisni od njih.</p>.<p>Među prekonfigurisanim "
"filterima koji dolaze uz KDEPrint su:</p> <ul> <li>the <em>Enscript tekst "
"filter</em>;</li> <li>filter <em>Više stranica po listu</em>;</li> <li>a "
"<em>PostScript u PDF konvertor</em>;</li> <li>filter <em>Odabir stranice/"
"Redanje</em>;</li> <li>filter <em>Štampanje postera</em>;</li> <li>i neki "
"drugi....</li> </ul> <p>Da ubacite filter u ovu listu, kliknite na  ikonu "
"<em>lijevak</em> (ikona gore desno u koloni) i nastavite.</p> <p>Molimo "
"kliknite na druge elemente ovog dijaloškog prozora da saznate više o "
"KDEPrint pred-filterima. </p> </qt>"

