#: marginwidget.cpp:116
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Change Measurement Unit</b>.</p> <p>You can change the units of "
"measurement for the page margins here. Select from Millimeters, Centimeters, "
"Inches or Pixels (1 pixel == 1/72 inch.) </p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Promijeni Mjernu Jedinicu</b>.</p> <p>Ovdje možete promijeniti "
"mjerne jedinice za margine stranice. Odaberite od Milimetri, Centimetri, "
"Inči ili Pikseli (1 piksel = 1/72 inča.) </p> </qt>"

#: marginwidget.cpp:123
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>Custom Margins Checkbox</b>.</p> <p>Enable this checkbox if you "
"want to modify the margins of your printouts.</p> <p>You can change margin "
"settings in 4 ways: <ul> <li>Edit the text fields.</li> <li>Click spinbox "
"arrows.</li> <li>Move the scroll wheel of a wheel mouse.</li> <li>Use the "
"mouse to drag margins in the preview frame.</li> </ul> <b>Note:</b> The "
"margin setting does not work if you load files into kprinter which have "
"their margins hardcoded internally, such as most PDF or PostScript files. It "
"works for all ASCII text files however. It also may not work with non-KDE "
"applications which fail to fully utilize the KDEPrint framework, such as "
"OpenOffice.org.</p> </qt>"
msgstr ""
" <qt> <p><b>Polje Vlastite Margine</b>.</p> <p>Označite ovo polje ukoliko "
"želite da mijenjate margine vašeg printanog materijala.</p> <p>Možete "
"mijenjati postavke margina na 4 načina: <ul> <li>Uređivanjem tekstualnog "
"polja.</li> <li>Klikanjem na strelice.</li> <li>Pomjeranjem klizača na mišu."
"</li> <li>Korištenjem miša za pomjeranje margina u preglednom okviru.</li> </"
"ul> <b>Napomena:</b> Postavke margina neće raditi ukoliko otvorite datoteku "
"u kprinter koja ima kodirane margine interno, kao većina PDF ili PostScript "
"fajlova. Postavke rade za sve ASCII tekstualne fajlove. Moguće je da neće "
"raditi sa aplikacijama koje nisu KDE jer nisu u mogučnosti da koriste "
"KDEPrint sistem, kako OpenOffice.org.</p> </qt>"

#: marginwidget.cpp:140
msgid ""
" <qt> <p><b>\"Drag-your-Margins\"</b>.</p> <p>Use your mouse to drag and set "
